
Project Status — Modular Dataset Validator
Purpose

This project is a modular dataset validator for a custom robotics dataset shaped similarly to LeRobot v2, but not assumed to be stock LeRobot v2.

The validator must remain dataset-path driven and metadata-driven. Dataset paths vary between runs, so no dataset root, camera count, action dimension, state dimension, FPS, or camera names should be hard-coded when those values can be discovered from the dataset.

The long-term goal is to expose the existing validator as a reusable analysis engine behind a UI workflow where users can choose a dataset, inspect detected metadata, control validation thresholds/tolerances, run validation, monitor progress, inspect episode evidence, and export results.

