Planned UI transformation

The validator is now intended to become:

Existing validation engine
        ↓
Application/service layer
        ↓
API layer
        ↓
UI frontend

The UI must not duplicate validation logic.

The UI is responsible for:

Dataset selection.
Dataset inspection.
Configuration controls.
Configuration review.
Run start/stop.
Progress display.
Results display.
Episode investigation.
Evidence visualization.
Report/export actions.

The existing src/lerobot_validator checks remain the actual analysis engine.

