Planned run persistence

Each validation run should preserve the exact dataset reference, resolved configuration, validator version/context, progress metadata, and results.

Conceptual structure:

runs/
└── <run-id>/
    ├── config.json
    ├── dataset.json
    ├── progress.json
    ├── results.json
    ├── summary.json
    └── report.html

A run must store the fully resolved configuration, not just a profile name, so validation can be reproduced later.

